===Etymology 2===
From {{proto|Finno-Ugric|piŋe|lang=fi}}; a cognate of Hungarian {{term|fog|lang=hu}}.

====Noun====
{{fi-noun|pii|type=pii}}

# {{archaic|lang=fi}} A [[tooth]].
# {{dated|lang=fi}} A [[thorn]], [[prong]], [[tooth]] or similar element e.g. in a plant, a saw or a rake.
# {{nautical|lang=fi}} The position of a sailing vessel, when she is set so that its bow points steadily to the direction of the wind. Used in expressions:
#* ''olla '''piissä'''''
#** to lie [[hove-to]]
#* ''asettua '''piihin'''''
#** to [[heave-to]]

=====Declension=====
{{fi-decl-voi|pi|i|ä}}

